Ored AI — Re-enter AI Training Mode

You will starts from "C:\Users\username" (change username to your name).

The model is ored50m: about 50 million parameters (49,894,912), config
configs\ored50m.yaml. The old char_transformer model is gone; no command in this
guide uses it.

